# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map problem to a quantum circuit {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-quantum-circuit}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: I-map ang problema sa quantum circuit {#step-1-map-problem-to-a-quantum-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we generate the SIAM Hamiltonian in the position basis. The Hamiltonian is represented by the matrix $h_{pq}$ and the tensor $h_{pqrs}$. Then, we rotate it to the momentum basis. In the position basis, we place the impurity at the first site. However, when we rotate to the momentum basis, we move the impurity to a central site to facilitate interactions with other orbitals.\n"
msgstr "Una, bubuo tayo ng SIAM Hamiltonian sa position basis. Ang Hamiltonian ay kinakatawan ng matrix $h_{pq}$ at ng tensor $h_{pqrs}$. Pagkatapos, ire-rotate natin ito sa momentum basis. Sa position basis, inilalagay natin ang impurity sa unang site. Gayunpaman, kapag nag-rotate tayo sa momentum basis, inililipat natin ang impurity sa gitnang site upang mapadali ang mga interaction sa ibang orbitals.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we generate the circuits to produce the Krylov basis states.\n"
"For each spin species, the initial state $\\ket{\\psi_0}$ is given by the superposition of all possible excitations of the three electrons closest to the Fermi level into the 4 closest empty modes starting from the state $|00\\cdots 0011 \\cdots 11\\rangle$, and realized by the application of seven [XXPlusYYGate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)s.\n"
"The time-evolved states are produced by successive applications of a second-order Trotter step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, bubuo tayo ng mga circuit upang makagawa ng Krylov basis states.\n"
"Para sa bawat spin species, ang initial state $\\ket{\\psi_0}$ ay binibigay ng superposition ng lahat ng posibleng excitations ng tatlong electrons na pinakamalapit sa Fermi level tungo sa 4 na pinakamalapit na walang lamang modes simula sa state na $|00\\cdots 0011 \\cdots 11\\rangle$, at napagtanto sa pamamagitan ng aplikasyon ng pitong [XXPlusYYGate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)s.\n"
"Ang time-evolved states ay ginawa sa pamamagitan ng sunud-sunod na mga aplikasyon ng second-order Trotter step.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a more detailed description of this model and how the circuits are designed, refer to [\"Quantum-Centric Algorithm for Sample-Based Krylov Diagonalization\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"
msgstr "Para sa mas detalyadong paglalarawan ng modelong ito at kung paano dinisenyo ang mga circuit, sumangguni sa [\"Quantum-Centric Algorithm for Sample-Based Krylov Diagonalization\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.09702).\n"

