msgid ""
"Now, we run a larger example on a real QPU.\n"
"For the reference energy, we use the results of a [DMRG](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Density_matrix_renormalization_group) calculation that was performed separately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon, magpapatakbo tayo ng mas malaking halimbawa sa isang tunay na QPU.\n"
"Para sa reference energy, ginagamit natin ang mga resulta ng [DMRG](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Density_matrix_renormalization_group) calculation na isinagawa nang hiwalay.\n"

